  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of five years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - 2\tDetailed drawings of landscaping, a means of enclosure at the front and how private amenity space in the rear garden is divided shall be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority before development commences and the development shall not be carried out otherwise than in accordance with any such approval given.",
    "Condition : 3 - Details of the car parking layout, as illustrated on drawing number SB 2861 1, shall be submitted to and approved by the Council, and the approved details fully implemented, before the flats hereby approved are occupied.",
    "Condition : 4 - Reason for approval:\r\n\tWith appropriate safeguarding conditions it is considered that the conversion of the existing offices into 1 x two bed flat and 1 x one bed flat incorporating alterations to fenestration and new canopy, would be acceptable and complementary to the visual amenity of the locality, and would not be detrimental to the amenities of the adjoining and neighbouring properties.  The development is in accordance with policies ENV.B.1.1 (All New Development), H.3.5 (Release of Employment Uses to Residential), H.4.2 (Residential Density), H.6.4 (Extensions and Alterations) and T.1.4 (Car and Cycle Parking and Servicing Facilities) of the London Borough of Hounslow UDP. Adopted December 2003.\r\n"
  ],
